# T4: TIMED arm B of the paired ABAB on coding prompts, eight users live (audits off): A = c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-time-gate (the control: the same eight 262k seats, no levers, the 21,760-block
# pool), B = c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-best-time-gate (the nine levers, the quad blocks, 19,968 blocks). The pair differs in the levers, the quad blocks and the pool size alone. The control is the audits-OFF
# time-gate, not the audited gate profile: an audited arm adds a blocking readback per round and is never a timing control. Arms alternate A B A B in this one image, each after its own all-four reset.
# The tests: warmup, one coding stream, eight 32k code users and eight about 120,000-token users (concurrent8_code_128k, 800 out), eight live at once.
# READ: the [PACKED-PHASE] round times of the eight-user tests, PAIRED per round, never by unpaired medians (check the load average around the run: a busy host skews a timed phase 10 to 20%, so
# no build, no CI push and no other job beside it), the per-seat rate = committed tokens per round per user / round time, and the texts equal between the arms. Then offline: python scripts/ci/speed_window_compare.py
# <A results> <B results> --users 0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7 --position-keyed --strict-concurrent-prefixes (exit 0 identical). Duration (estimate): 90 min. Soft.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/262k8 eight-seat 262k development window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/262k8 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-262k8-best-1 is what B0 builds from the pushed tp4/262k8 commit; every later job serves that one image. A commit of a
# file the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-262k8-best-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-best-time-gate
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent8_code_32k,concurrent8_code_128k
